<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Mount Brandon via the Faha corrie — Faha corrie and summit return [planning only — not navigation-grade]</name><desc>Start the Mount Brandon walk at the small Faha car park outside Cloghane on Kerry’s Dingle Peninsula, Ireland. Pass the grotto, enter the lake-filled mountain hollow and climb the Éisc, a steep gully leading to the main ridge. Turn toward Mount Brandon’s summit and return the same way. The enclosed cliffs open into broad Atlantic views in clear weather. Allow around six hours and take particular care on the steep descent. Choose a favourable forecast and carry reliable navigation.

Route geometry: © OpenStreetMap contributors — OpenStreetMap route and path geometry. Licence: ODbL-1.0 (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/). Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="52.2392992" lon="-10.205609"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2393666" lon="-10.2055535"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2394878" lon="-10.205635"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2392621" lon="-10.206481"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2392668" lon="-10.2066323"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2393476" lon="-10.2070242"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2394855" lon="-10.2074278"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2396114" lon="-10.207812"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2396613" lon="-10.2081846"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2398942" lon="-10.2085222"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.239956" lon="-10.2089995"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.239994" lon="-10.2095117"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2399726" lon="-10.210218"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2400368" lon="-10.2106604"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2400463" lon="-10.2107691"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2399988" lon="-10.2109553"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2400059" lon="-10.2111649"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2399726" lon="-10.21139"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2400273" lon="-10.2115607"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2400843" lon="-10.2118168"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2401841" lon="-10.2125735"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.240253" lon="-10.2129694"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2403172" lon="-10.2132876"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2403671" lon="-10.2136873"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2403528" lon="-10.2139279"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2403053" lon="-10.2140404"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2403409" lon="-10.2141607"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2403314" lon="-10.2143004"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2403386" lon="-10.2144945"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2403885" lon="-10.2147079"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2404835" lon="-10.214867"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2404598" lon="-10.2149834"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.240474" lon="-10.2151891"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.240531" lon="-10.2153016"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2405643" lon="-10.2154142"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.2406118" lon="-10.2157557"></trkpt><trkp